WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:06.423
Mama pushed Rapunzel into the secret room.

2
00:00:06.424 --> 00:00:09.086
"Hide!" she said.

3
00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:12.968
"Don't make a sound!" Papa said.

4
00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:18.301
He closed the door, and they hurried away.

5
00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:21.600
"Hmm," Rapunzel thought.

6
00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:25.121
She opened the door a crack to see.

7
00:00:25.122 --> 00:00:30.652
An old woman stomped over to Rapunzel's parents.

8
00:00:30.653 --> 00:00:34.682
She wore a beautiful silk shawl.

9
00:00:34.683 --> 00:00:38.388
The woman glared at Mama and Papa.

10
00:00:38.389 --> 00:00:42.445
"You thought you could run away from me!

11
00:00:42.446 --> 00:00:45.894
Well, now I have found you.

12
00:00:45.895 --> 00:00:49.938
Where is that baby of yours?"

13
00:00:49.939 --> 00:00:58.239
Mama gulped. "Our . . . our daughter is dead."

14
00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.515
Papa nodded. "She's very dead!

15
00:01:02.516 --> 00:01:11.841
It happened . . . um . . . last winter!"

16
00:01:11.842 --> 00:01:15.364
"Ugh." Rapunzel groaned.

17
00:01:15.365 --> 00:01:18.759
Her parents never lied.

18
00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:26.295
"And they're not very good at it!" she thought.

19
00:01:26.296 --> 00:01:31.575
"Liars!" the witch shouted at Mama and Papa.

20
00:01:31.576 --> 00:01:36.182
"You are trying to break your promise!"

21
00:01:36.183 --> 00:01:38.417
Rapunzel gulped.

22
00:01:38.418 --> 00:01:42.870
The witch looked very angry!

23
00:01:42.871 --> 00:01:48.669
Just then the witch spotted the bird in the bush.

24
00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:55.800
She pointed at it and said a strange word.

25
00:01:55.801 --> 00:02:00.743
The bird turned into a small hedgehog!

26
00:02:00.744 --> 00:02:03.939
The hedgehog fell to the ground.

27
00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.624
It curled into a ball.

28
00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:10.949
"Poor thing!" Rapunzel whispered.

29
00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.566
"This is all my fault!"

30
00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:18.688
Rapunzel had to stop the witch.

31
00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:21.426
"But how?" she thought.

32
00:02:21.427 --> 00:02:25.165
"I do not know any magic."

33
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:29.692
"Beware!" the witch snapped at Mama and Papa.

34
00:02:29.693 --> 00:02:33.501
"I can do lots of magic.

35
00:02:33.502 --> 00:02:36.165
Your daughter will come with me.

36
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:41.855
Or I will turn you into hedgehogs!"

37
00:02:41.856 --> 00:02:45.233
Mama grabbed Papa's hand.

38
00:02:45.234 --> 00:02:48.328
"Our daughter is never going with you!"

39
00:02:48.329 --> 00:02:52.203
Papa scowled. "Never!"

40
00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:56.849
The witch stomped her foot. "Very well!"

41
00:02:56.850 --> 00:03:03.129
The witch pointed her finger at Mama and Papa.

42
00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:07.331
She opened her mouth, and—

43
00:03:07.332 --> 00:03:10.968
"No!" Rapunzel cried.

44
00:03:10.969 --> 00:03:15.204
She ran out of the secret room.

45
00:03:15.205 --> 00:03:19.793
Rapunzel jumped in front of her parents.

46
00:03:19.794 --> 00:03:24.785
"Here I am, Witch!" she said.

